## Push notifications

`modules/users/push.py`, exported from `users/public.py`. In another module:
`notifier: PushNotifierDep`, then
`await notifier.notify_user(user_id, PushNotification(title=..., body=...))`.
Devices register through `POST /auth/device-token`; a token FCM rejects is
dropped. Set `GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE` to a Firebase service account key
(Firebase console, Project settings, Service accounts); until then pushes are
only logged.
